      "en": "The vessels that are given to you for the service of the house of your God, deliver before the God of Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "네 하나님의 전에서 섬기는 일을 위하여 네게 준 기명은 예루살렘 하나님 앞에 드리고",
      "source_text_hash": "ce15d95c793e5e3812257c8da76ee49bad7d5ae79b84c7ee5f32aee125cf1b51",
      "translation_text_hash": "4a9a5e7abc4ae987e3c33c6677437a2b36a7e941f712caf589e62265f004bd7f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
